==Description==
'''Star Wars Skins''' is a skin series based on ''Star Wars''. This skin series is unique, as it does not actually have any obtainable crate which it is obtained from. Instead, skins will only appear in the [[Daily Store#Daily Skin Store|Daily Skin Store]].

The cost of the skin depends on their rarity. {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|3,000}} while {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|5,000}}.

